<title>ITALY: TENNIS-BOLOGNA INTERNATIONAL MEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BOLOGNA INTERNATIONAL MEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOLOGNA, Italy 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the $328,000 Bologna international men's clay court tennis tournament on Monday (prefix denotes seeds): 1-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Gilbert Schaller (Austria) 6-1 6-1 Albert Portas (Spain) beat Emilio Alvarez (Spain) 6-4 3-6 7-6 (7-1) 3-Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Christophe Van Garsse (Belgium) 6-4 6-4 Marzio Martelli (Italy) beat Thierry Champion (France) 4-6 7-6 (7-5) 6-1 Quino Munoz (Spain) beat Johan Van Herck (Belgium) 6-4 7-5</p>
</text>
